 30-year Treasury yield climbed to 5.29%, its highest since 2007, as investors worry about rising U.S. debt, heavy bond issuance and persistent inflation. AI-related corporate borrowing and weaker demand for long-term bonds are adding", "feed": "DeItaone", "ts": "2026-08-17T17:18:31+00:00", "url": "https://t.me/walter_bloomberg/34813", "status": "partial", "excerpt": "", "citation": "US 30-YEAR YIELD HITS 2007 HIGH The 30-year Treasury yield climbed to 5.29%, its highest since 2007, as investors worry about rising U.S. debt, heavy bond issuance and persistent inflation. AI-related corporate borrowing and weaker demand for long-term bonds are adding \u2014 DeItaone, 2026-08-17. https://t.me/walter_bloomberg/34813"}, {"title": "Yes Bank eyes dollar bond market after six-year hiatus, arrangers appointed: Why now?", "feed": "Mint Markets", "ts": "2026-08-17T16:48:28+00:00", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/yes-bank-eyes-dollar-bond-market-after-six-year-hiatus-arrangers-appointed-why-now-11786981933063.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Yes Bank is preparing to return to the international bond market for the first time since the Indian private-sector lender wrote off a troubled local bond in 2020, according to a Bloomberg report citing people familiar with the matter.\n\nThe bank has appointed arrangers for a potential dollar bond issue and plans to sell a benchmark-sized three-year US dollar-denominated note. Yes Bank is scheduled to begin discussions with fixed-income investors from Monday, Bloomberg reported.\n\nThe proposed issuance comes as Indian banks have stepped up fundraising in overseas markets. Other lenders from the country have raised about $5.27 billion over the past two months, helped by measures introduced by t", "citation": "Yes Bank eyes dollar bond market after six-year hiatus, arrangers appointed: Why now? \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-17. https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/yes-bank-eyes-dollar-bond-market-after-six-year-hiatus-arrangers-appointed-why-now-11786981933063.html"}, {"title": "CITADEL: FED POLICY KEEPING TREASURY YIELDS HIGH Citadel Securities says the Fed\u2019s policy approach is helping keep long-term Treasury yields near multi-decade highs, creating broader market risks. The 30-year yield topped 5.28%, its highest in 19 years, despite softer inflation", "feed": "DeItaone", "ts": "2026-08-17T16:28:27+00:00", "url": "https://t.me/walter_bloomberg/34808", "status": "partial", "excerpt": "", "citation": "CITADEL: FED POLICY KEEPING TREASURY YIELDS HIGH Citadel Securities says the Fed\u2019s policy approach is helping keep long-term Treasury yields near multi-decade highs, creating broader market risks. The 30-year yield topped 5.28%, its highest in 19 years, despite softer inflation \u2014 DeItaone, 2026-08-17. https://t.me/walter_bloomberg/34808"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "ust_30y", "name": "FRED \u00b7 DGS30", "url": "https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/DGS30"}, {"series": "dyn_bond", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 BOND", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BOND"}, {"series": "ust_10y", "name": "FRED \u00b7 DGS10", "url": "https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/DGS10"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"ust_30y": 0.74, "dyn_bond": -0.75, "ust_10y": 1.11}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-05-22", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"ust_30y": 0.74, "dyn_bond": -0.75, "ust_10y": 1.11}}, {"date": "2026-03-30", "distance": 0.12, "member_z": {"ust_30y": 0.8, "dyn_bond": -0.89, "ust_10y": 0.96}}, {"date": "2025-04-23", "distance": 0.18, "member_z": {"ust_30y": 0.99, "dyn_bond": -0.83, "ust_10y": 0.92}}, {"date": "2026-05-08", "distance": 0.32, "member_z": {"ust_30y": 0.49, "dyn_bond": -0.53, "ust_10y": 0.67}}, {"date": "2025-12-31", "distance": 0.32, "member_z": {"ust_30y": 1.22, "dyn_bond": -1.03, "ust_10y": 1.12}}], "aftermath": {"ust_30y": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": -0.41, "hit_rate_up": 0.2, "min_pct": -3.52, "max_pct": 3.43}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct":